{"id":"t5-hafazan","tahap":"T5","nama":"Hafazan (KAFA)","sk":"Hafazan","ikon":"📖","warna":"#7A5AB8","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 5 (ikut e-buku Hafazan Tahun 5)","semak":"pending ustaz review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.68","sumber":"The owner's e-BOOK HAFAZAN Tahun 5 (JAIS); Quran text from the app's KFGQPC Uthmani data; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t5-hafazan-1","nama":"Surah Al-Insyiqaq","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-84 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai dua puluh lima ayat (25 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Langit terbelah"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah Al-Insyiqaq"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنشَقَّتْ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَذِنَتْ لِرَبِّهَا وَحُقَّتْ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْأَرْضُ مُدَّتْ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَلْقَتْ مَا فِيهَا وَتَخَلَّتْ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَذِنَتْ لِرَبِّهَا وَحُقَّتْ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ إِنَّكَ كَادِحٌ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ كَدْحًا فَمُلَـٰقِيهِ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَمَّا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِتَـٰبَهُۥ بِيَمِينِهِۦ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَسَوْفَ يُحَاسَبُ حِسَابًا يَسِيرًا</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَيَنقَلِبُ إِلَىٰٓ أَهْلِهِۦ مَسْرُورًا</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَمَّا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِتَـٰبَهُۥ وَرَآءَ ظَهْرِهِۦ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَسَوْفَ يَدْعُواْ ثُبُورًا</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَيَصْلَىٰ سَعِيرًا</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ فِىٓ أَهْلِهِۦ مَسْرُورًا</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّهُۥ ظَنَّ أَن لَّن يَحُورَ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">بَلَىٰٓ إِنَّ رَبَّهُۥ كَانَ بِهِۦ بَصِيرًا</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِٱلشَّفَقِ</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلَّيْلِ وَمَا وَسَقَ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْقَمَرِ إِذَا ٱتَّسَقَ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لَتَرْكَبُنَّ طَبَقًا عَن طَبَقٍ</span> (19)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَمَا لَهُمْ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ</span> (20)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا قُرِئَ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْقُرْءَانُ لَا يَسْجُدُونَ ۩</span> (21)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">بَلِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ يُكَذِّبُونَ</span> (22)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا يُوعُونَ</span> (23)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَبَشِّرْهُم بِعَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ</span> (24)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُمْ أَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُونِۭ</span> (25)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Apabila langit terbelah dan bumi diratakan, manusia akan menemui Tuhannya. Sesiapa yang menerima surat amalannya dengan tangan kanan akan dihisab dengan mudah dan pulang dengan gembira. Sesiapa yang menerimanya dari belakang akan memanggil kebinasaan dan masuk ke dalam neraka."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Setiap manusia ada buku catatan amalan","Kita berusaha supaya menerima buku amalan dengan tangan kanan","Sujud tilawah ketika membaca ayat sajdah"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["Al-Insyiqaq","Maksudnya: Langit terbelah."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t5-hafazan-2","nama":"Surah Al-Mutaffifin","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-83 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai tiga puluh enam ayat (36 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Orang yang curang dalam timbangan"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah Al-Mutaffifin"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَيْلٌ لِّلْمُطَفِّفِينَ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلَّذِينَ إِذَا ٱكْتَالُواْ عَلَى ٱلنَّاسِ يَسْتَوْفُونَ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا كَالُوهُمْ أَو وَّزَنُوهُمْ يُخْسِرُونَ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَلَا يَظُنُّ أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ أَنَّهُم مَّبْعُوثُونَ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لِيَوْمٍ عَظِيمٍ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَوْمَ يَقُومُ ٱلنَّاسُ لِرَبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّآ إِنَّ كِتَـٰبَ ٱلْفُجَّارِ لَفِى سِجِّينٍ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَآ أَدْرَٮٰكَ مَا سِجِّينٌ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كِتَـٰبٌ مَّرْقُومٌ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَيْلٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلَّذِينَ يُكَذِّبُونَ بِيَوْمِ ٱلدِّينِ</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا يُكَذِّبُ بِهِۦٓ إِلَّا كُلُّ مُعْتَدٍ أَثِيمٍ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِ ءَايَـٰتُنَا قَالَ أَسَـٰطِيرُ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّا‌ۖ بَلْۜ رَانَ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِم مَّا كَانُواْ يَكْسِبُونَ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّآ إِنَّهُمْ عَن رَّبِّهِمْ يَوْمَئِذٍ لَّمَحْجُوبُونَ</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ إِنَّهُمْ لَصَالُواْ ٱلْجَحِيمِ</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ يُقَالُ هَـٰذَا ٱلَّذِى كُنتُم بِهِۦ تُكَذِّبُونَ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّآ إِنَّ كِتَـٰبَ ٱلْأَبْرَارِ لَفِى عِلِّيِّينَ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَآ أَدْرَٮٰكَ مَا عِلِّيُّونَ</span> (19)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كِتَـٰبٌ مَّرْقُومٌ</span> (20)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَشْهَدُهُ ٱلْمُقَرَّبُونَ</span> (21)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ ٱلْأَبْرَارَ لَفِى نَعِيمٍ</span> (22)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">عَلَى ٱلْأَرَآئِكِ يَنظُرُونَ</span> (23)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">تَعْرِفُ فِى وُجُوهِهِمْ نَضْرَةَ ٱلنَّعِيمِ</span> (24)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يُسْقَوْنَ مِن رَّحِيقٍ مَّخْتُومٍ</span> (25)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">خِتَـٰمُهُۥ مِسْكٌ‌ۚ وَفِى ذَٰلِكَ فَلْيَتَنَافَسِ ٱلْمُتَنَـٰفِسُونَ</span> (26)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمِزَاجُهُۥ مِن تَسْنِيمٍ</span> (27)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">عَيْنًا يَشْرَبُ بِهَا ٱلْمُقَرَّبُونَ</span> (28)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ أَجْرَمُواْ كَانُواْ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ يَضْحَكُونَ</span> (29)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا مَرُّواْ بِهِمْ يَتَغَامَزُونَ</span> (30)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱنقَلَبُوٓاْ إِلَىٰٓ أَهْلِهِمُ ٱنقَلَبُواْ فَكِهِينَ</span> (31)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا رَأَوْهُمْ قَالُوٓاْ إِنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ لَضَآلُّونَ</span> (32)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَآ أُرْسِلُواْ عَلَيْهِمْ حَـٰفِظِينَ</span> (33)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَٱلْيَوْمَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ مِنَ ٱلْكُفَّارِ يَضْحَكُونَ</span> (34)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">عَلَى ٱلْأَرَآئِكِ يَنظُرُونَ</span> (35)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">هَلْ ثُوِّبَ ٱلْكُفَّارُ مَا كَانُواْ يَفْعَلُونَ</span> (36)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Celakalah orang yang curang dalam timbangan dan sukatan. Mereka mengambil dengan cukup tetapi mengurangkan apabila memberi. Kitab amalan orang yang derhaka di dalam Sijjin, dan kitab amalan orang yang baik di dalam 'Illiyyin."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Kita tidak menipu dalam jual beli","Menipu ialah dosa besar dan ciri orang munafik","Orang yang baik akan mendapat nikmat syurga"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["Al-Mutaffifin","Maksudnya: Orang yang curang dalam timbangan."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t5-hafazan-3","nama":"Surah Al-Infitar","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-82 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai sembilan belas ayat (19 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Langit pecah"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah Al-Infitar"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنفَطَرَتْ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْكَوَاكِبُ ٱنتَثَرَتْ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْبِحَارُ فُجِّرَتْ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْقُبُورُ بُعْثِرَتْ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">عَلِمَتْ نَفْسٌ مَّا قَدَّمَتْ وَأَخَّرَتْ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مَا غَرَّكَ بِرَبِّكَ ٱلْكَرِيمِ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكَ فَسَوَّٮٰكَ فَعَدَلَكَ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فِىٓ أَىِّ صُورَةٍ مَّا شَآءَ رَكَّبَكَ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّا بَلْ تُكَذِّبُونَ بِٱلدِّينِ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِنَّ عَلَيْكُمْ لَحَـٰفِظِينَ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كِرَامًا كَـٰتِبِينَ</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَعْلَمُونَ مَا تَفْعَلُونَ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ ٱلْأَبْرَارَ لَفِى نَعِيمٍ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِنَّ ٱلْفُجَّارَ لَفِى جَحِيمٍ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَصْلَوْنَهَا يَوْمَ ٱلدِّينِ</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا هُمْ عَنْهَا بِغَآئِبِينَ</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَآ أَدْرَٮٰكَ مَا يَوْمُ ٱلدِّينِ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ مَآ أَدْرَٮٰكَ مَا يَوْمُ ٱلدِّينِ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَوْمَ لَا تَمْلِكُ نَفْسٌ لِّنَفْسٍ شَيْــًٔا‌ۖ وَٱلْأَمْرُ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلَّهِ</span> (19)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Apabila langit terbelah, bintang berguguran, lautan meluap dan kubur dibongkar, setiap jiwa akan mengetahui amalannya. Malaikat yang mulia mencatat semua perbuatan manusia. Pada hari pembalasan, segala urusan hanya milik Allah."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Allah menjadikan manusia dalam keadaan yang sempurna","Malaikat mencatat semua amalan kita","Kita sentiasa mensyukuri nikmat Allah"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["Al-Infitar","Maksudnya: Langit pecah."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t5-hafazan-4","nama":"Surah At-Takwir","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-81 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai dua puluh sembilan ayat (29 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Menggulung"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah At-Takwir"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِذَا ٱلشَّمْسُ كُوِّرَتْ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلنُّجُومُ ٱنكَدَرَتْ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْجِبَالُ سُيِّرَتْ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْعِشَارُ عُطِّلَتْ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْوُحُوشُ حُشِرَتْ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْبِحَارُ سُجِّرَتْ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلنُّفُوسُ زُوِّجَتْ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْمَوْءُۥدَةُ سُئِلَتْ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">بِأَىِّ ذَنۢبٍ قُتِلَتْ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلصُّحُفُ نُشِرَتْ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ كُشِطَتْ</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْجَحِيمُ سُعِّرَتْ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِذَا ٱلْجَنَّةُ أُزْلِفَتْ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">عَلِمَتْ نَفْسٌ مَّآ أَحْضَرَتْ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِٱلْخُنَّسِ</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلْجَوَارِ ٱلْكُنَّسِ</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا عَسْعَسَ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلصُّبْحِ إِذَا تَنَفَّسَ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلُ رَسُولٍ كَرِيمٍ</span> (19)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ذِى قُوَّةٍ عِندَ ذِى ٱلْعَرْشِ مَكِينٍ</span> (20)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">مُّطَاعٍ ثَمَّ أَمِينٍ</span> (21)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا صَاحِبُكُم بِمَجْنُونٍ</span> (22)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَلَقَدْ رَءَاهُ بِٱلْأُفُقِ ٱلْمُبِينِ</span> (23)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا هُوَ عَلَى ٱلْغَيْبِ بِضَنِينٍ</span> (24)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا هُوَ بِقَوْلِ شَيْطَـٰنٍ رَّجِيمٍ</span> (25)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَيْنَ تَذْهَبُونَ</span> (26)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْرٌ لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ</span> (27)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لِمَن شَآءَ مِنكُمْ أَن يَسْتَقِيمَ</span> (28)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا تَشَآءُونَ إِلَّآ أَن يَشَآءَ ٱللَّهُ رَبُّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ</span> (29)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Apabila matahari digulung, bintang berguguran dan gunung dihancurkan, setiap jiwa mengetahui amalan yang telah disediakannya. Al-Quran ialah kalam Allah yang disampaikan oleh Jibril, utusan yang mulia, sebagai peringatan bagi sekalian alam."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Al-Quran diturunkan untuk seluruh umat manusia","Kita menjadikan al-Quran panduan hidup","Hari kiamat pasti berlaku"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["At-Takwir","Maksudnya: Menggulung."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t5-hafazan-5","nama":"Ulang kaji hafazan Tahun 5","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Surah yang dihafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Al-Insyiqaq: 25 ayat","Al-Mutaffifin: 36 ayat","Al-Infitar: 19 ayat","At-Takwir: 29 ayat"]},{"j":"h","t":"Doa"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">رَبَّنَا لَا تُزِغْ قُلُوبَنَا بَعْدَ إِذْ هَدَيْتَنَا وَهَبْ لَنَا مِنْ لَدُنْكَ رَحْمَةً إِنَّكَ أَنْتَ الْوَهَّابُ</span>"},{"j":"p","t":"Maksudnya: Wahai Tuhan kami, janganlah Engkau pesongkan hati kami selepas Engkau memberi petunjuk kepada kami, dan kurniakanlah kepada kami rahmat daripada sisi-Mu."}],"glosari":[["Sijjin","Tempat catatan amalan orang yang derhaka."],["'Illiyyin","Tempat catatan amalan orang yang baik."],["Mutaffifin","Orang yang curang dalam timbangan."]]}]}